NativeSupporterVault + RethSupporterVault + YsyBoldSupporterVault::initialize
├── Given implementation or already initialized proxy
│   └── It rejects initialization/reinitialization
├── Given zero/EOA/self/overlapping custody identity or wrong decimals
│   └── Atomic proxy construction reverts
├── Given rETH registry mismatches token or balances target has no code
│   └── It fails closed rather than reading another token's accounting
├── Given ysyBOLD underlying or API version differs from reviewed 3.0.4
│   └── It rejects the semantic mismatch at initialization and runtime
└── Given verified identities
    └── It starts with entry/harvest disabled and numeric production limits unset
